{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211290?t=1741771077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/7ba06e5ad88db424ef3c328edc3d092358bd0af8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741771077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/3c62b42b2eaf176f268abca6207d3f4822409aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741771077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/3c62b42b2eaf176f268abca6207d3f4822409aa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741771077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>","